"settings (Preferences) or in the Android app settings. The server then "
"drops errors that occur while handling your requests. Errors that have no"
" connection to a signed-in user, such as a server start-up failure, are "
"governed by the operator's setting."
msgstr ""
"You can turn it off at any time with Send error reports in your account "
"settings (Preferences) or in the Android app settings. The server then "
"drops errors that occur while handling your requests. Errors that have no"
